  "description": "Lauf Seigla is designed for maximum speed on gravel. Without compromise!\n\nWhile other gravel bikes make you feel fast by rattling around on skinny tires and unforgiving frames, Lauf Seigla focuses on truly making you fast.\n\nThe class-leading compliance and tire clearance on Seigla make it glide over road imperfections, with minimal energy loss. You will notice it through comfort and grip*. Your GPS-unit will notice it through personal Strava records!\n\nA good bike can be designed by diligently playing by the book. While making a great bike, that outshines the competition, demands new thinking. Unshackled by tradition and convention.\n\n* Probably feeling slower! As the human body uses NVH (noise, vibration and harshness) to measure speed.",
